  data: {
    LLM: "Try to win early tricks so you can declare trumps if you have a marriage. The first marriage declaration is crucial as it sets trumps for the whole hand.\n\nDecide whether to declare your own marriage or ask partner. Declaring yourself gives 2 points and sets trumps immediately. Asking partner can be safer but 'breaks' your own marriages. Track which marriages have been 'broken'.\n\nThe 'half marriage' declaration can be a clever tactic - it breaks all marriages in both hands, preventing opponents from declaring trumps later. Timing when to declare is key: too early and opponents know the trump suit; too late and opponent might declare first.",
    Player: "Try to win early tricks so you can declare trumps if you have a marriage. The first marriage declaration is crucial as it sets trumps for the whole hand.\n\nDecide whether to declare your own marriage or ask partner. Declaring yourself gives 2 points and sets trumps immediately. Asking partner can be safer but 'breaks' your own marriages. Track which marriages have been 'broken'.\n\nThe 'half marriage' declaration can be a clever tactic - it breaks all marriages in both hands, preventing opponents from declaring trumps later. Timing when to declare is key: too early and opponents know the trump suit; too late and opponent might declare first.",
    aggressiveness: 0.5,
